t": 19.081, "end": 20.602, "text": "It runs all week, apparently."}, {"start": 21.442, "end": 23.443, "text": "Now, let us go through your results."}, {"start": 24.684, "end": 25.324, "text": "Yes, please."}, {"start": 26.345, "end": 28.466, "text": "I understand the diagnosis has been confirmed."}, {"start": 29.49, "end": 29.89, "text": "It has."}, {"start": 30.651, "end": 33.293, "text": "Your blood work confirms type 2 diabetes."}, {"start": 34.434, "end": 36.735, "text": "And that rests on the hemoglobin A1c?"}, {"start": 37.716, "end": 38.036, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 38.617, "end": 41.179, "text": "Your hemoglobin A1c is elevated."}, {"start": 42.299, "end": 45.181, "text": "So the raised long-term sugar value is what confirms it?"}, {"start": 46.242, "end": 48.804, "text": "That is the finding we are relying on, yes."}, {"start": 50.045, "end": 50.385, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 51.246, "end": 52.327, "text": "What is the treatment plan?"}, {"start": 53.467, "end": 55.229, "text": "We are starting you on metformin."}, {"start": 56.31, "end": 56.89, "text": "Metformin."}, {"start": 57.694, "end": 60.235, "text": "That is the standard first-line agent as I understand it."}, {"start": 61.196, "end": 61.536, "text": "It is."}, {"start": 62.176, "end": 64.037, "text": "We are beginning your treatment with it now."}, {"start": 65.298, "end": 65.538, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 66.259, "end": 68.24, "text": "And will anyone else be involved in my care?"}, {"start": 69.3, "end": 69.64, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 70.121, "end": 72.082, "text": "I am referring you to the diabetes nurse."}, {"start": 73.242, "end": 73.883, "text": "That is helpful."}, {"start": 74.743, "end": 77.024, "text": "I would rather have the support than manage this alone."}, {"start": 78.065, "end": 80.346, "text": "That is exactly why the referral is there."}, {"start": 81.507, "end": 82.047, "text": "Understood."}, {"start": 83.208, "end": 84.749, "text": "How are you feeling about all of this?"}, {"start": 86.069, "end": 87.39, "text": "Reasonably calm, honestly."}, {"start": 88.35, "end": 90.251, "text": "I had prepared myself for the confirmation."}, {"start": 91.351, "end": 93.191, "text": "That is a good place to start from."}, {"start": 94.432, "end": 94.812, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 95.692, "end": 96.852, "text": "I appreciate the clarity."}, {"start": 97.833, "end": 98.293, "text": "Of course."}, {"start": 99.253, "end": 101.294, "text": "Were you hoping to get outdoors this weekend?"}, {"start": 101.934, "end": 103.654, "text": "The forecast is not promising."}, {"start": 104.794, "end": 105.355, "text": "I saw that."}, {"start": 106.355, "end": 109.116, "text": "Rain most of Saturday, so indoor plans, I think."}, {"start": 110.236, "end": 110.736, "text": "Sensible."}, {"start": 111.656, "end": 113.217, "text": "Then that is everything for today."}, {"start": 113.957, "end": 114.917, "text": "Take care, Mikkel."}, {"start": 116.078, "end": 116.758, "text": "Thank you, Doctor."}, {"start": 117.398, "end": 117.798, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.038}}